{"3878190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wordcaster", "steam_appid": 3878190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your voice is your weapon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wordcaster</strong> is a voice-driven RPG adventure where you step into the robes of a wizard, casting spells by speaking words aloud. Real-time speech recognition listens to your voice and unleashes magic against enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Wordcaster, every spell comes from your voice. Choose from a variety of spellbooks, each with its own set of words and power multipliers. Face waves of enemies across multiple worlds, take down challenging bosses, and collect coins to upgrade your wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is built around classic RPG elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spellbooks</strong> with unique vocabularies and damage multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levels &amp; XP</strong> to grow stronger and unlock new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coins &amp; Shops</strong> to purchase upgrades and customize your wizard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re mastering basic words or commanding advanced spellbooks, every victory comes from how clearly and quickly you can cast your spells.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your voice is your weapon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wordcaster</strong> is a voice-driven RPG adventure where you step into the robes of a wizard, casting spells by speaking words aloud. Real-time speech recognition listens to your voice and unleashes magic against enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Wordcaster, every spell comes from your voice. Choose from a variety of spellbooks, each with its own set of words and power multipliers. Face waves of enemies across multiple worlds, take down challenging bosses, and collect coins to upgrade your wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression is built around classic RPG elements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spellbooks</strong> with unique vocabularies and damage multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levels &amp; XP</strong> to grow stronger and unlock new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coins &amp; Shops</strong> to purchase upgrades and customize your wizard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re mastering basic words or commanding advanced spellbooks, every victory comes from how clearly and quickly you can cast your spells.</p>", "short_description": "Wordcaster is a voice-driven RPG adventure where you become a wizard, casting spells by speaking words aloud. Real-time speech recognition turns your voice into magical attacks against enemies. Unlock spellbooks, battle bosses, collect coins, and level up in a unique voice-powered RPG experience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878190/d9cd4c236cf0e336c6d4f90e51cbef9dc7653bee/header.jpg?t=1784774452", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878190/b849b6e8c74eff5757091ef7f7560561a29f85cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784774452", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878190/b849b6e8c74eff5757091ef7f7560561a29f85cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784774452", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Window